{"name":"Dainty Debutante","hex":"#f4bdb3","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dainty","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Elegant; delicately small and pretty.","Fastidious and fussy, especially when eating."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A delicacy (choice or pleasing food).","A fancy cookie, pastry, or square, frequently homemade, served at a social event."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dainty"},{"term":"debutante","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A young woman who makes her first formal appearance in society.","A female debutant, especially in sport and entertainment."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/debutante"}],"entries":[{"title":"Debutante","blocks":[{"text":"A debutante, also spelled débutante, or deb is a young woman of aristocratic or upper-class family background who has reached maturity and is presented to society at a formal \"debut\" or debutante ball. Originally, the term indicated that the woman was old enough to be married, and one purpose of her \"coming out\" was to display her to eligible bachelors and their families with a view to marriage within a select circle."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Deb%C3%BCtantinnen_Chrysanthemenball_2012.jpg/330px-Deb%C3%BCtantinnen_Chrysanthemenball_2012.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Debutante"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/4_Mira_Sorvino_Vienna_2013.jpg/500px-4_Mira_Sorvino_Vienna_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/4_Mira_Sorvino_Vienna_2013.jpg/1280px-4_Mira_Sorvino_Vienna_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/4_Mira_Sorvino_Vienna_2013.jpg/500px-4